{"4116770": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "AI TALK 33 Car Robot Modavuj Market Simulator", "steam_appid": 4116770, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI TALK 33 Car Robot Modavuj Market Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you can chat with AI customers, build and grow your own market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.mp4?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Starting with a small shop, you'll deal with the whims of fickle customers, stock shelves, set prices, and ultimately strive to grow into a massive grocery empire!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=342 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/d2ef6052d74744f41e4b230fa7dfcf30.mp4?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >So, what awaits you?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🛒 Shelf Management – ​​Don't leave shelves empty, or customers will look at you like, &quot;Is this a market or a warehouse?&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💸 Price Setting – Sell cheaply, and customers will be happy. Sell expensively, and your coffers will fill up. But be careful, overdoing it will make you trend on social media.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >👥 Customer Relations – Clear the queue quickly and avoid impatient customers grumbling at the door.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >📦 Inventory Management – ​​Don't let products run out; keep track of suppliers. Otherwise, customers leave empty-handed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏗️ Market Expansion – From a small market to a giant supermarket. Open new shelves and sell more products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🎯 Your Own Strategy – Whether you're a &quot;cheap hero&quot; or a &quot;high-priced but prestigious&quot; seller, it's your market, the choice is yours!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready? There's only one truth in this world: Empty shelves mean a tired customer. 😂</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>AI TALK 33 Car Robot Modavuj Market Simulator</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a fun business simulation where you can chat with AI customers, build and grow your own market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.poster.avif?t=1768478327\" width=640 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4116770/extras/63ba415313f495fbe1b304e404a7cfcb.webm?t=1768478327\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/app